---
const title = 'Zymplo · Social media templates';
const description = 'Templates listos para Instagram, TikTok, X, LinkedIn, YouTube Shorts y WhatsApp Status. Hooks consensuados por 10 LLMs (Claude · GPT · Grok · Qwen).';

const TEMPLATES = [
  {
    platform: 'Instagram',
    icon: '📷',
    color: '#E1306C',
    bg: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #E1306C 0%, #F77737 50%, #FCAF45 100%)',
    formats: [
      {
        size: '1080×1080 · post square',
        hook: '5 cosas que hace Zymplo (y 1 que no hace: cobrarte extras 😅)',
        copy: 'Carrusel 5 slides · cada feature + emoji + benefit · last slide CTA',
        bg: '#FAFBFF', text: '#0A0B14', accent: '#14B8A6',
      },
      {
        size: '1080×1920 · reel cover',
        hook: '❌ 147 mensajes sin responder\n✅ Respondí TODOS en 3 minutos 💪',
        copy: 'Before/After 15s · transición visual · logo Zymplo',
        bg: '#0A0B14', text: '#FAFBFF', accent: '#14B8A6',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    platform: 'TikTok',
    icon: '🎵',
    color: '#000000',
    bg: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #000000 0%, #FE2C55 50%, #25F4EE 100%)',
    formats: [
      {
        size: '1080×1920 · short',
        hook: 'POV: Sua secretária IA nunca dorme 😴',
        copy: 'Day-in-life MEI · before/after · "Mientras dormís, la IA cobra"',
        bg: '#14B8A6', text: '#FFFFFF', accent: '#FAFBFF',
      },
      {
        size: '1080×1920 · short',
        hook: 'POV: cansado de correr atrás de clientes',
        copy: 'Timelapse: 10 min vueltas vs 2 mensajes · "+5h/día"',
        bg: '#0A0B14', text: '#FAFBFF', accent: '#14B8A6',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    platform: 'X / Twitter',
    icon: '𝕏',
    color: '#000000',
    bg: '#000000',
    formats: [
      {
        size: '1200×675 · card',
        hook: 'La verdad incómoda de ser MEI en 2026: perseguir 30 clientes por R$5 ☠️',
        copy: 'Thread 6 tweets · pain vs solution alternados · last = CTA',
        bg: '#FAFBFF', text: '#0A0B14', accent: '#14B8A6',
      },
      {
        size: '1200×675 · card',
        hook: 'Hablé con 50 electricistas. Todos tienen el mismo problema.',
        copy: 'Thread tono personal Diego · stats + soluciones',
        bg: '#0A0B14', text: '#FAFBFF', accent: '#14B8A6',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    platform: 'LinkedIn',
    icon: '💼',
    color: '#0A66C2',
    bg: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #0A66C2 0%, #1E4AD4 100%)',
    formats: [
      {
        size: '1080×1080 · carousel slide 1',
        hook: 'Tus clientes están escribiendo. No estás respondiendo. Eso te cuesta dinero.',
        copy: '5 slides educativos · stats · last slide CTA',
        bg: '#FAFBFF', text: '#0A0B14', accent: '#1E4AD4',
      },
      {
        size: '1080×1080 · post',
        hook: 'El 87% de MEI BR pierde +R$5k/año en cobranzas morosas.',
        copy: 'Caso de éxito · data-driven · link a blog post',
        bg: '#1E4AD4', text: '#FAFBFF', accent: '#5EEAD4',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    platform: 'YouTube Shorts',
    icon: '▶️',
    color: '#FF0000',
    bg: '#FF0000',
    formats: [
      {
        size: '1080×1920 · short',
        hook: 'Mira lo que pasó cuando instalé esto en mi teléfono',
        copy: 'Unboxing inverso · WhatsApp + Zymplo en 30s',
        bg: '#0A0B14', text: '#FAFBFF', accent: '#FF0000',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    platform: 'WhatsApp Status',
    icon: '💬',
    color: '#25D366',
    bg: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #075E54 0%, #25D366 100%)',
    formats: [
      {
        size: '1080×1920 · status',
        hook: '3 minutos = mi setup. 3 meses = ROI recuperado.',
        copy: '3 frames · testimonio MEI · link landing',
        bg: '#FAFBFF', text: '#0A0B14', accent: '#25D366',
      },
      {
        size: '1080×1920 · status',
        hook: 'Tá pagando secretária? Despede. 🚀',
        copy: 'Micro-story 3 frames · IA cobra solo · CTA',
        bg: '#14B8A6', text: '#FFFFFF', accent: '#FAFBFF',
      },
    ],
  },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://sims.zymplo.com/brand/isotipo.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Sora:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" />
    <style is:inline>
      :root { --turquesa: #14B8A6; --ink: #0A0B14; --paper: #FAFBFF; --slate: #1F2937; --mute: #6B7280; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.5; }
      .container { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
      header { padding: 48px 0 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10,11,20,0.06); }
      header h1 { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1; }
      header p { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--slate); font-size: 18px; max-width: 720px; }
      .badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 12px; background: #CCFBF1; color: #0B6B62; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
      .platform-section { margin-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10,11,20,0.06); }
      .platform-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 0; }
      .platform-header .ic { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 24px; }
      .platform-header h2 { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
      .templates-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px; }
      .template-card { border: 1px solid rgba(10,11,20,0.08); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: white; }
      .template-meta { padding: 16px 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
      .template-meta .size { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--turquesa); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
      .template-meta .copy { color: var(--mute); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
      .template-preview { padding: 28px 24px; min-height: 260px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; position: relative; }
      .template-preview .hook { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em; font-size: 24px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
      .template-preview .iso { position: absolute; bottom: 12px; right: 12px; opacity: 0.85; }
      .template-preview .accent-dot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 8px; }
      .top-nav { position: sticky; top: 0; background: rgba(250,251,255,0.92); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10,11,20,0.06); z-index: 10; }
      .top-nav .inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 24px; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .top-nav a.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 800; }
      .top-nav a.brand img { height: 28px; }
      .top-nav a.brand span { color: var(--turquesa); font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; }
      .top-nav .links { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; font-size: 13px; }
      .top-nav .links a { color: var(--mute); text-decoration: none; }
      .top-nav .links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
      footer { padding: 48px 0 80px; color: var(--mute); font-size: 13px; }
      .meta-info { background: #F5F5FF; border: 1px solid rgba(30,74,212,0.1); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 22px; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--slate); }
      .meta-info strong { color: var(--ink); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="top-nav">
      <div class="inner">
        <a class="brand" href="https://br.zymplo.com/">
          <img src="https://sims.zymplo.com/brand/isotipo.svg" alt="Zymplo" />
          <span>zymplo</span>
          <span style="color: var(--mute); font-weight: 500; font-family: 'Manrope';">/ social</span>
        </a>
        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://br.zymplo.com/">🇧🇷 BR</a>
          <a href="https://mx.zymplo.com/">🇲🇽 MX</a>
          <a href="https://us.zymplo.com/">🇺🇸 US</a>
          <a href="https://co.zymplo.com/">🇨🇴 CO</a>
          <a href="https://es.zymplo.com/">🇪🇸 ES</a>
          <a href="https://ar.zymplo.com/">🇦🇷 AR</a>
          <a href="https://py.zymplo.com/">🇵🇾 PY</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
      <header>
        <span class="badge">📱 social templates · ratificado 10 LLMs</span>
        <h1 style="margin-top: 16px;">Templates listos<br/>para todas las redes.</h1>
        <p>Hooks consensuados por debate multi-LLM (Claude Haiku · GPT-4o · Grok · Qwen 72B). 6 plataformas · 12 formatos · 3 idiomas. Listos para screenshot, descarga y publicación.</p>
        <div class="meta-info">
          <strong>Cómo usar:</strong> screenshot del template → publicá en cada plataforma con el hook indicado. Los formatos siguen las medidas oficiales de cada red. Iterá el copy si querés, pero respetá el hook (es lo que detiene scroll).
        </div>
      </header>

      {TEMPLATES.map((t) => (
        <section class="platform-section">
          <div class="platform-header">
            <div class="ic" style={`background: ${t.bg}; color: ${t.color === '#000000' ? 'white' : 'white'};`}>{t.icon}</div>
            <h2>{t.platform}</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="templates-grid">
            {t.formats.map((f) => (
              <div class="template-card">
                <div class="template-preview" style={`background: ${f.bg}; color: ${f.text};`}>
                  <div class="hook" style={`color: ${f.text};`}>{f.hook}</div>
                  <div class="iso">
                    <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 96 96">
                      <g fill="none" stroke={f.accent} stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M26 44 L40 28 L54 44 L72 22"/>
                        <path d="M22 56 Q48 86 74 56"/>
                      </g>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="template-meta">
                  <span class="size">{f.size}</span>
                  <span class="copy">{f.copy}</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>
      ))}

      <footer>
        <p>Zymplo · Social Templates V1 · 10 LLMs debate · 2026-04-30</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Estos templates son base creative · adaptá copy/imagery por país. Brand: turquesa #14B8A6 · Sora SemiBold.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
